    "question": "Sam and Drew have a combined age of 54. Sam is half of Drew's age. How old is Sam?",
    "gold": "18",
    "answer": "Let x be Drew's age.\nSam is (1/2)x\nx+(1/2)x=54\n(3/2)x=54\n3x=108\nx=<<36=36>>36\nSam is 36/2=<<36/2=18>>18 years old\n#### 18"
